---
title: Assessments, coaching, and safety
date: '2026-06-16'
tags:
  - added
  - fixed
summary: Assessment and guided-exercise flows, coaching and journal detail routes, and limited crisis-language matching were added to the source app.
---

This source milestone added attachment and stress-response self-reflection flows,
PHQ-9 and GAD-7 score displays, a guided CBT-style exercise library, and detail
routes for saved coaching sessions and journal entries. The app also added a
weekly-reflection panel and selectable AI-provider configuration. These features
were not clinically validated as a combined product or shown to improve health.

A deterministic keyword matcher can surface crisis-resource links beside some
coaching and journal responses. It cannot reliably detect every crisis or replace
human support. A prior generated weekly reflection may retain details from a
journal entry after that entry is deleted; account-wide erasure is not implemented.

The older paired landing stills showed marketing copy, not verified footage of
the assessment, exercise, or coaching flows. They are withdrawn from this entry
while real paired light/dark product captures, narrated videos, annotations,
captions, and posters are produced and reviewed.
